* ============================================================
* DotTalk++ Modern Non-Destructive Smoke Test
* Updated from old Jan 6 script
* ============================================================
* Purpose:
*   Exercise current command/help/path/schema/index/filter/relation/
*   expression/tuple surfaces without destructive mutation.
*
* Deliberately excluded or neutralized:
*   APPEND, REPLACE, DELETE, RECALL, PACK, ZAP, ERASE, COPY mutation,
*   UI launches, old INX-only SETINDEX path, unsupported SCHEMA calls.
* ============================================================

VERSION
SETPATH
DIR

HELP
FOXHELP
CMDHELP
COMMANDSHELP
PREDHELP
PREDICATES

ECHO FOXPALETTE   <---- TVISION APP
COLOR DEFAULT

DO SANDBOX
SCHEMAS CLOSE
SCHEMAS OPEN DBF
SCHEMAS

SELECT STUDENTS
SHOW
STATUS
STRUCT
FIELDS
WSREPORT

COLOR DEFAULT
SHOW
STATUS
STRUCT
FIELDS

AREA
RECNO
TOP
RECNO
BOTTOM
RECNO
RECORD
RECORDVIEW
DISPLAY
LIST 10

ECHO READY

* ------------------------------------------------------------
* Current CDX/LMDB index workflow
* ------------------------------------------------------------

SET INDEX TO students
SET ORDER TO TAG LNAME

TOP
RECNO
TUPLE *
SMARTLIST LNAME,FNAME,SID NEXT 10

SEEK "WHITE"
RECNO
DISPLAY
FIND "WHITE" IN LNAME
RECNO
DISPLAY

ASCEND
SMARTLIST LNAME,FNAME,SID NEXT 10

DESCEND
SMARTLIST LNAME,FNAME,SID NEXT 10

ASCEND

* ------------------------------------------------------------
* Unique setting smoke only
* ------------------------------------------------------------

SET UNIQUE FIELD SID ON
SET UNIQUE FIELD SID OFF

* ------------------------------------------------------------
* Relation smoke
* ------------------------------------------------------------

GOTO 1
SET RELATION TO SID INTO ENROLL
REL_REFRESH
REL LIST
CMDREL

TUPLE *
TUPLE LNAME,FNAME
TUPLE #6.*

* ------------------------------------------------------------
* Filtering and predicate smoke
* ------------------------------------------------------------

SET FILTER TO GPA > 3
LIST 10 FOR GPA > 3
SMARTLIST SID,LNAME,FNAME,GPA NEXT 10 FOR GPA >= 2.5

SET FILTER TO

WHERE GPA < 2
SMARTLIST SID,LNAME,FNAME,GPA NEXT 10

* ------------------------------------------------------------
* SQL smoke
* ------------------------------------------------------------

SQL SELECT * FROM STUDENTS WHERE GPA >= 3
SQLSEL SELECT SID,LNAME,FNAME FROM STUDENTS

* ------------------------------------------------------------
* Normalization / validation
* ------------------------------------------------------------

NORMALIZE D 8 20250101
VALIDATE UNIQUE FIELD SID IGNORE DELETED

* ------------------------------------------------------------
* LOOP smoke
* ------------------------------------------------------------

GOTO 1
LOOP
ECHO LOOP_BASE
ENDLOOP

GOTO 1
LOOP 4
ECHO LOOP_COUNT
ENDLOOP

GOTO 1
LOOP FOR GPA >= 3
RECNO
ENDLOOP

GOTO 1
LOOP FOR LNAME = "WHITE"
DISPLAY
ENDLOOP

* ------------------------------------------------------------
* SCAN smoke
* ------------------------------------------------------------

GOTO 1
SCAN FOR RECNO < 5
ECHO SCAN_WHILE_EQUIV
SKIP 1
ENDSCAN

GOTO 1
SCAN FOR RECNO <= 5
ECHO SCAN_UNTIL_EQUIV
SKIP 1
ENDSCAN

LOOP_BUFFER
SCAN_BUFFER

* ------------------------------------------------------------
* Reflection / catalog checks
* ------------------------------------------------------------

CMDARGCHK
CMDHELPCHK
CMDREL

* ------------------------------------------------------------
* UI commands: echo only, do not launch in smoke test
* ------------------------------------------------------------

COLOR AMBER
ECHO BROWSE   <---- TVISION APP
ECHO BROWSETUI   <---- TVISION APP
ECHO BROWSETV   <---- TVISION APP
ECHO TVISION   <---- TVISION APP
ECHO FOXPRO   <---- TVISION APP
ECHO FOXTALK   <---- TVISION APP
ECHO GENERIC   <---- TVISION APP

COLOR DEFAULT

* ------------------------------------------------------------
* Non-destructive command presence checks
* ------------------------------------------------------------

ECHO !
ECHO BANG

GO TOP
GOTO 1

REFRESH
RECORD

SET
TEST

* ------------------------------------------------------------
* Expression / evaluator smoke
* ------------------------------------------------------------

CALC 1 + 1
CALC SOUNDEX("WHITE")
CALC UPPER("abc")
CALC (GPA + 1)

FORMULA LNAME + ", " + FNAME

* Known canaries - keep, but inspect manually
EVAL 2+2
EVAL 3*3
BOOLEAN .T.

* ------------------------------------------------------------
* Tuple normalization harness
* ------------------------------------------------------------

ECHO TTEST   <---- TVISION APP
TUPTALK
TUPTALK RESET
TUPTALK ADD C 10 "abc"
TUPTALK ADD N 8 0 50000001
TUPTALK ADD D 8 20250101
TUPTALK LIST
TUPTALK NORMALIZE

* ------------------------------------------------------------
* Final table re-open / WHERE debug canary
* ------------------------------------------------------------

USE STUDENTS
SET INDEX TO students
SET ORDER TO TAG LNAME

WHERE GPA = GPA DEBUG
CALC 1 + 1

ECHO DONE